async function teacherDashboard(){if(!staffUser())return;await loadClasses();const w=modal('🧑‍🏫 Teacher Mission Control',true),filters=el('div','row filterbar'),sel=el('select','field'),sj=el('select','field');sel.setAttribute('aria-label','Dashboard class');sj.setAttribute('aria-label','Dashboard subject');APP.classes.filter(c=>c.grade===Number($('gradeFilter').value)).forEach(c=>sel.append(new Option(c.name,c.id)));sj.append(new Option('All subjects','all'));D.forEach(s=>sj.append(new Option(s.en,s.id)));sj.value=$('subjectFilter').value;filters.append(sel,sj,button('＋ Create class',()=>createClass(),true),button('＋ Add content',()=>editor(),true));w.append(el('p','mut','Grade '+$('gradeFilter').value+' · Completed means at least 60%. Performance uses the best score for each assessed task.'),filters);const area=el('div');w.append(area);async function draw(){area.replaceChildren();if(!sel.value){area.append(empty('Create a class for this grade, then share its join code.'));return}const c=APP.classes.find(c=>c.id===sel.value);area.append(el('div','recovery','Join code · '+c.code));const p=new URLSearchParams({class:sel.value,subject:sj.value}),r=await call('/api/dashboard?'+p);const awards=el('div','appgrid');const active=el('div','scoreBadge');active.append(el('span',null,'🚀 Most active'),el('b',null,r.mostActive?.name||'Awaiting assessed work'),el('small','mut',r.mostActive?r.mostActive.completed+' completed tasks':'Based on distinct tasks passed, not logins'));const high=el('div','scoreBadge');high.append(el('span',null,'🏆 Highest performance'),el('b',null,r.highestPerformance?.name||'Awaiting 3 assessed tasks'),el('small','mut',r.highestPerformance?r.highestPerformance.score+'% best-score average':'At least three assessed tasks required'));awards.append(active,high);area.append(awards);const exports=el('div','row appnav');for(const format of ['xlsx','csv']){const a=el('a','btn o',format==='xlsx'?'📗 Export Excel':'📄 Export CSV');a.href='/api/report?'+p+'&format='+format;exports.append(a)}area.append(exports);const wrap=el('div','tablewrap'),table=el('table','report');table.innerHTML='<thead><tr><th>Student</th><th>Completed</th><th>Performance</th><th>Topics to practise</th><th>Assigned missions</th><th>Account</th></tr></thead>';const tb=el('tbody');r.members.forEach(m=>{const tr=el('tr');[m.name+' (@'+m.username+')',m.completed+' / '+m.assessed,m.performance===null?'—':m.performance+'%',m.practice.join(', ')||'No gaps recorded',m.missions.map(x=>x.title+': '+x.status+(x.score===null?'':' ('+x.score+'%)')).join('\n')||'No class missions'].forEach(t=>tr.append(el('td',null,t)));const td=el('td');td.append(button('Reset password',()=>resetStudent(m),true));tr.append(td);tb.append(tr)});table.append(tb);wrap.append(table);area.append(wrap);if(!r.members.length)area.append(empty('No students yet. Share the join code with this class.'));area.append(el('h3',null,'Assigned missions'));const mg=el('div','links');r.missions.filter(c=>sj.value==='all'||c.subject===sj.value).forEach(c=>mg.append(card(c)));area.append(mg);area.append(el('h3',null,'Quiz and follow-up results'));const rg=el('div','appgrid');r.results.slice(0,30).forEach(x=>{const b=el('div','scoreBadge');b.append(el('b',null,x.name),el('span',null,x.title+' · '+x.score+'/'+x.total),button('Review answers',()=>review(x),true));rg.append(b)});area.append(rg)}sel.onchange=sj.onchange=handle(draw);await draw()}
